      "content": "I can certainly help you prioritize where to send your limited supplies. When looking at stability and efficiency, you should focus on areas with established, reliable local leadership and a known, manageable population density. Communities that are already somewhat organized and have a clear infrastructure, even if damaged, will be the most efficient recipients for immediate aid.",
